<title>FRANCE: Breakdown of Havas shareholdings.</title>
<headline>Breakdown of Havas shareholdings.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Havas gave the following breakdown of its share capital after a deal with Generale des Eaux.</p>
<p>    Generale des Eaux  30   percent</p>
<p>    Alcatel Alsthom     7.1 percent</p>
<p>    Canal Plus	    4.8 percent</p>
<p>    Societe Generale    4.7 percent</p>
<p>    France Telecom	3.5 percent</p>
<p>    Audiofina	     3.3 percent</p>
<p>    Paribas		 2.9 percent</p>
<p>    Other small</p>
<p>	shareholders	7.5 percent</p>
<p>    On the market	36.2 percent</p>
<p>BEFORE THE DEAL</p>
<p>    Alcatel Alsthom    21.3 percent</p>
<p>    Canal Plus	   5.9 percent</p>
<p>    Societe Generale   5.9 percent</p>
<p>    France Telecom     4.4 percent</p>
<p>    Audiofina	    4.1 percent</p>
<p>    Paribas		3.6 percent</p>
<p>    Generale des Eaux  2.1 percent</p>
<p>    Other small</p>
<p>     shareholders	9.4 percent</p>
<p>    On the market     43.3 percent</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
